  "contentHtml": "<p>진짜 오래간만에 1학년을 맡게 되면서</p><p>재과만 선생님들의 도움 엄청 많이 받고 있습니다~^^</p><p>&#160;</p><p>비상교과서에서 만든 &#39;질문이 살아 있는 수업&#39; 활용하다 보니</p><p>렌즈 파트에 액체안경 이야기가 있더라구요~</p><p>아프리카와 같은 후진국에 안경을 보급하고자 하는 목적으로 몇십년을 연구했다는 이야기와</p><p>주입하는 실리콘 오일의 양을 조절해 도수를 변화시켜 여러사람이 함께 사용할 수 있다는 이야기가 인상적입니다.</p><p>내용이 너무 좋아서 공유하고도 싶고, 또 질문도 있어서 글 남깁니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>질문1) 관련 내용 QR코드 있어서 찍어 보니 분명 한글 자막이 있는데, 주소를 복사해서 수업에 활용하려고 하면</p><p>&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160; 자막이 사라집니다. 주소와 QR코드 모두 올립니다. 한글자막이 필요합니다. 도와주세요~^^</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4c8fa28c18dcb116c46fb5d600df547f672c155c\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4c8fa28c18dcb116c46fb5d600df547f672c155c\" data-origin-width=\"200\" data-origin-height=\"200\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160; <a href=\"https://www.ted.com/talks/joshua_silver_adjustable_liquid_filled_eyeglasses?utm_campaign=tedspread&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_source=tedcomshare\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://www.ted.com/talks/joshua_silver_adjustable_liquid_filled_eyeglasses?utm_campaign=tedspread&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_source=tedcomshare</a>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"Adjustable liquid-filled eyeglasses\" data-og-description=\"Josh Silver delivers his brilliantly simple solution for correcting vision at the lowest cost possible -- adjustable, liquid-filled lenses. At TEDGlobal 2009, he demos his affordable eyeglasses and reveals his global plan to distribute them to a billion pe\" data-og-host=\"www.ted.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://www.ted.com/talks/joshua_silver_adjustable_liquid_filled_eyeglasses?utm_campaign=tedspread&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_source=tedcomshare\" data-og-url=\"https://www.ted.com/talks/joshua_silver_adjustable_liquid_filled_eyeglasses\" data-og-image=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/cvmUkC/hyLCBsy1cw/OR0okfT8Z9kYuKkmUfkH80/img.jpg?width=800&amp;height=550&amp;face=361_115_502_268,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/VZuox/hyLCFhq1r1/319VrSBup5RjPbOqDCiYQk/img.jpg?width=800&amp;height=600&amp;face=355_108_505_271\"><a href=\"https://www.ted.com/talks/joshua_silver_adjustable_liquid_filled_eyeglasses?utm_campaign=tedspread&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_source=tedcomshare\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://www.ted.com/talks/joshua_silver_adjustable_liquid_filled_eyeglasses?utm_campaign=tedspread&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_source=tedcomshare\"><div class=\"og-image\" style=\"background-image:url(https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/cvmUkC/hyLCBsy1cw/OR0okfT8Z9kYuKkmUfkH80/img.jpg?width=800&amp;height=550&amp;face=361_115_502_268,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/VZuox/hyLCFhq1r1/319VrSBup5RjPbOqDCiYQk/img.jpg?width=800&amp;height=600&amp;face=355_108_505_271)\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">Adjustable liquid-filled eyeglasses</p><p class=\"og-desc\">Josh Silver delivers his brilliantly simple solution for correcting vision at the lowest cost possible -- adjustable, liquid-filled lenses. At TEDGlobal 2009, he demos his affordable eyeglasses and reveals his global plan to distribute them to a billion pe</p><p class=\"og-host\">www.ted.com</p></div></a></div><p>&#160;</p><p>질문2) 기사를 보니 &#39;스펀지&#39;프로그램에 조슈아 실버가 출연해 액체안경을 비밀을 자세히 풀어나간 모양입니다.</p><p>&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160; 사실 아이들은 TED 영상보다도 스펀지 영상을 더 집중해서 볼 것 같은데... 영상을 찾을 수가 없네요.</p><p>&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160; 혹시 영상 가지고 있으신 선생님 계시면 공유 부탁드립니다~</p><p>&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
